Third-party material
--------------------

The curated subset (curated/pippa-subset.jsonl and curated/review.jsonl,
published as a Hugging Face dataset, not in this repository) contains
conversations from PIPPA, the Personal
Interaction Pairs between People and AI dataset (Gosling, Dale, Zheng;
PygmalionAI), https://huggingface.co/datasets/PygmalionAI/PIPPA, which its
dataset card lists under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Citation:

  Gosling, Dale, Zheng. "PIPPA: A Partially Synthetic Conversational
  Dataset." 2023. https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.05884

Changes made to the PIPPA material:
  - 80 conversations were selected from pippa_deduped.jsonl by hand.
  - Each row was cut to bot_id, bot_name, bot_greeting, bot_description, and
    conversation. All other fields were dropped. The conversation text is
    not edited.
  - curated/review.jsonl records which turns of each conversation were used
    (start and end) and any edit made to the character card (system).

The conversations are user-written fiction between people and chatbots and
include mature themes. See curated/README.md.

Everything else (authored/, eval/, fixtures/, results/, and the code) is
original to this project. The scenarios in authored/ and eval/ are synthetic.
The base model (Qwen3.5-4B, MLX 4-bit) and trained adapters are not
distributed here and keep their own licenses.
